  description: "4 Level 5 monsters\nWhen an opponent's monster declares an attack:
    You can destroy all cards your opponent controls. If this card has \"Number 69:
    Heraldry Crest\" as an Xyz Material, it gains this effect.\n\u25CF Once per turn:
    You can detach 1 Xyz Material from this card, then target 1 face-up Xyz Monster
    your opponent controls; this card gains ATK equal to that face-up monster's original
    ATK, and if it gains ATK this way, this card's name becomes that monster's, and
    it gains that monster's original effect. These effects last until the End Phase."
